; Real binary frame for `SemioBrepMutation` (protocol::OpBinary) -- `format` byte + `tag` byte
; (the variant ordinal, see 🧬️mutations/🦀️.rs's OP_KEYWORDS/variant_ordinal) + the
; variant's own opaque "key=value ..." argument text tail (see ../📝️text/🔤️.ebnf for
; that text's real per-keyword grammar, restated here for a self-contained ABNF reading of the
; frame only).
document = format tag payload
format   = %x01                        ; OP_BINARY_FORMAT
tag      = OCTET                       ; SemioBrepMutation variant ordinal, 0-22
payload  = *OCTET                      ; UTF-8 "key=value ..." argument text, keyword-stripped
